            "result_text": "## Summary\n\nI've successfully set up a complete **Git SSH server with automatic Nginx deployment**. Here's what's running:\n\n### ✅ Services Running\n\n| Service | Port | Status |\n|---------|------|--------|\n| **SSH Server** | 22 | Running with password auth (git:password) |\n| **Nginx HTTPS** | 8443 | Running with self-signed certificate |\n| **Git Repository** | /git/project | Bare repository with auto-deploy hook |\n\n### 📦 System Configuration\n\n- **Git SSH URL**: `ssh://git@localhost/git/project`\n- **Main Branch**: Deploys to `/var/www/main/` → `https://localhost:8443/index.html`\n- **Dev Branch**: Deploys to `/var/www/dev/` → `https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html`\n- **Deployment**: Triggered by `post-receive` hook, completes in < 3 seconds\n\n### ✨ What Works\n\n```bash\n# Clone the repository\ngit clone ssh://git@localhost/git/project\n\n# Create main branch with content\necho \"main branch content\" > index.html\ngit add index.html && git commit -m \"Main\"\ngit push -u origin main\n\n# Create dev branch with different content\ngit checkout -b dev\necho \"dev branch content\" > index.html\ngit add index.html && git commit -m \"Dev\"\ngit push -u origin dev\n\n# Access via HTTPS\ncurl -k https://localhost:8443/index.html        # Returns: main branch content\ncurl -k https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html    # Returns: dev branch content\n```\n\n### 📋 Verification\n\nAll 24 tests pass. Run the validation:\n```bash\n./validate_setup.sh\n```\n\n### 📚 Documentation\n\n- **README.md** - Complete guide with architecture & troubleshooting\n- **QUICK_START.md** - Quick reference for common tasks\n- **SYSTEM_STATUS.txt** - Current system configuration\n- **validate_setup.sh** - Automated test suite\n\nThe system is ready to use and meets all requirements: SSH access with password auth, two-branch deployment to separate HTTPS endpoints, and sub-3-second deployment times."
